## POCKET CALCULATOR (instrumental cover) for PULP/SKRED
#  134 BPM, bright major electronic, 88 bars (~2:38). Instrumental only.
#  Self-contained: drums are built-in waves 82-99.
#     [pocket_calculator.sk] /ls      then:   play     (stop:  stop)
#
#  Inspired by Kraftwerk’s 1981 classic.
#  Key elements:
#    - Steady motorik 4/4 pulse
#    - Deep sequenced bass
#    - Bright square/saw lead for the main riff
#    - Distinct high “little melody” (the calculator motif)
#    - Sparse, precise arrangement with clear breathing room
#
#  VOICE MAP
#    v0 kick   v1 snare   v2 closed hat   v3 open hat   v5 crash
#    v6 deep bass (centre) + v7 subtle detuned partner
#    v8 main lead (bright square)
#    v13 little melody / calculator motif (high, pure)
#    v16 soft noise / texture
#    v24 pad LFO   v26-v27 pad prototype   v28-v35 pad pool
#  DELAY BUSES
#    1  short clean slap on lead
#    2  longer wash on pad / melody
#  PATTERNS
#    0 conductor   1 kick   2 snare   3 hats
#    6 bass        8 main lead   9 little melody
#    11 pad        13 fill       14 pump
# ======================================================================

[POCKET CALCULATOR] puts
M 134 16

## DELAY BUSES (clean and restrained)
DS 1 134 .25
DL 1 - - 3 0 0 7
DD 1 9 4
DS 2 134 .75
DL 2 - - 6 1 1 9
DD 2 7 3

